				184
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ ψύθος οὔνομ᾽ ἔχουσα,
			ψ.</span> is a Subst. in appos. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔνομα.</span></div>
